Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.18,0:08:35.87,IN_JP2,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(50,200)\blur3.5\k13}立{\k20}ち{\k39}止{\k36}ま{\k28}る{\k93}時{\k31} {\k27}見{\k15}上{\k35}げ{\k31}た{\k55}空{\k45}に{\k28}は{\k36} {\k172}今{\k130}も{\k38}あ{\k13}の{\k39}日{\k13}の{\k132}星
