Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\frz2.784\c&H453B3D&\pos(808,433)}阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\frz2.784\c&H453B3D&\pos(890,1009)}阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.61,0:17:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,阿笑..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,妳看 位子超好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這個是..？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,小雪的聖誕演唱會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,阿哈 妳是冰無小雪的粉絲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的超期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,完全搶不到票耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不討厭含糖的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.12,0:18:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,優哥 糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,新聞說小雪中止活動了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,包括演唱會那些全部
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.85,0:18:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,說是身體出狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fscx2230\fscy1720\c&HF9F9F8&\frz335.7\pos(770,969)\iclip(124,410,410,674)}■
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.10,phone,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\frz335.7\pos(898,104)}冰無小雪活動中止
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.10,phone,,0,0,0,,{\frz336.7\pos(630,98)}冰無小雪的所屬事務所發佈了暫時中止\N其在演藝圈活動的消息。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.10,phone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(570,234)\frz337}由於消息太過倉促，使得網路上一片\N嘩然。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.10,phone,,0,0,0,,{\frz336.2\pos(520,380)}根據事務所的聲明，她本人的身體出了\N狀況，將來包括原本預定舉辦的演唱會\N等活動全部都會取消。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,優哥 小雪她不會有事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.27,0:18:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不曉得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.19,0:19:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\fad(600,0)\frz17.13\pos(748,551)}來電
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\fad(600,0)\frz17.13\pos(778,627)}阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\frz17.13\pos(748,551)}來電
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.03,0:19:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs45\bord0\frz17.13\pos(778,627)}阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,接通了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？小玉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.52,0:20:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個...一直聯繫不上妳 我很擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,妳發生什麼事了...？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.90,0:20:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,妳說沒事...但那怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉 妳現在人在哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我過去找妳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？小玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼叫作沒事！ 那怎麼可能啊..
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1588,651)}江之島 月台
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}車門即將關閉 請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.15,0:21:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那個時候我什麼都沒做到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,明明和那個時候一樣 現在的小玉也正徬徨無助
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.54,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,妳果然在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,擔心妳...電話又打不通..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,看到新聞說妳中止活動..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,知歲說妳連演唱會都中止..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我發不出聲音了...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦想開口唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不過沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想一定很快就會好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不用擔心我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.93,0:22:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,阿笑..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.83,0:22:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喜歡上你..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉..
